stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created : Ingest observation
    Created --> Analyzed : Context compiled
    Analyzed --> RiskAssessed : Multi-risk computed
    RiskAssessed --> PolicyValidated : Invariant check
    
    PolicyValidated --> Recommended : Compliance OK
    PolicyValidated --> Rejected : Policy block
    
    Recommended --> Presented : Render on screen console
    Presented --> Accepted : Operator click / Auto-release
    Presented --> Rejected : Operator dismisses / Override
    
    Accepted --> Executed : Tasks complete
    Executed --> Evaluated : Outcomes logged
    Evaluated --> Archived : Committed to memory
